{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26668","headline":"秋中寄崔道士 · 姚合","name":"秋中寄崔道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫居雀喧噪，况乃静巷陌。\n夜眠睡不成，空庭闻露滴。\n旁有一桮酒，欢然如对客。\n月光久逾明，照得笔墨白。\n平生志舒豁，难可似兹夕。\n四肢得自便，虽劳不爲役。\n故人山中住，善治活身策。\n五谷口不尝，比僧更闲寂。\n我今暂得安，自谓脱幽戚。\n君身长逍遥，日月争老得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}